Junior Accountant FR / ENG 100% (m / f)
For one of our clients, we are looking for a Junior Accountant FR / ENG in 100% permanent contract and based in Geneva. The collaborator will join the Accounting department of the company and support the accounting team in the day\-to\-day.
Junior Accountant FR / ENG 100% (m / f)
Our client is a financial services company managing multiple entities and bank accounts.
Missions
Joining the Accounting department;
Recording accounting entries for various companies and bank accounts;
Processing bank transactions, intercompany operations, investment movements, foreign exchange revaluations, accruals, and prepayments;
Reviewing and controling supplier invoices and expenses;
Coordinating with Treasury for supplier payments;
Preparing bank and balance sheet reconciliations;
Assisting with quarterly funding requests and management accounts;
Supporting annual budgeting and year\-end closing activities;
Maintaining accounting, banking, and administrative records;
Performing ad hoc analyses and supporting additional finance\-related projects as required;
Reporting to the clients and the Management;
Participation to the day to day in the office.
Profil du candidat
Accounting qualification and/or knowledge of accounting principles, ideally IFRS;
1 to 2 years of experience in a similar accounting function;
Proficient in Microsoft Office with strong IT aptitude and the ability to learn new systems quickly;
Fluent in French and English;
Reliable, rigorous, detail\-oriented, and organized;
Strong team player with a high degree of discretion and professionalism when handling confidential information.
Conditions et Avantages
Our client offers a 100% permanent contract within a qualitative, international and human\-sized working environment. jpidf122153jm jpit0936jm jpiy26jm
